      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2026-02-04T17:58:37.359Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When creating a purchase receipt, the system automatically takes the batch number.<br>\nThe item only has a batch number and no serial number.<br>\nHowever, during submission, the system requires both a batch number <em>and</em> a serial number.</p>\n<p>What can I change or configure so that the submission works without a serial number?</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/a587f6/{size}.png",
